Cell["\<\
Without a step count a single row of transitions is returned:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->159219362,ExpressionUUID->"c252b4d3-8931-41a5-99e8-0103fc103d8a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"IteratedFiniteAutomatonStateTransitions", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", "0"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"2", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"2", ",", "0"}], "}"}], "\[Rule]", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"2", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
